    <briefdescription>
<para>Class for furnishing kernels in bulk. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Given a json object, furnish every kernel under a &quot;kernels&quot; key. The kernels are unloaded as soon as the object goes out of scope.</para>
<para>Generally used on results from a kernel query. </para>
